The bundled city-name alias index is derived from GeoNames cities15000,
retrieved 2026-11-03: https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/cities15000.zip
Attribution: GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org/
Geographical data license: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes: selected cities with population >=500,000, retained Han alternate names,
removed city/county/district suffixes, added simplified New York aliases, sorted
by population, and retained up to three GeoNames identifiers per alias.
